# Fraud-Detection ML Serving Service

A lightweight Flask web application that serves a pre-trained Random Forest model over HTTP to score transactions synchronously.

## Project Structure

```text
/root/code/serving/
├── app.py          # Flask application handling /health and /predict endpoints
├── model.pkl       # Pre-trained RandomForest classifier
├── train.csv       # Training dataset used to fit the model
└── README.md       # Project documentation
