API Reference
Endpoint	Method	Description	Example Request Body	Expected Response
/health	GET	Service availability check	None	{"status":"ok"}
/predict	POST	Scores transaction data	{"amount": 3200, "hour": 23, "num_tx_past_day": 5}	{"is_fraud": 1}
Setup & Running Locally
Install required dependencies:

Bash
pip install flask scikit-learn pandas
Run the Flask application:

Bash
python3 app.py
